    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
              <div><ix:footnote id="Foot_a29b9d15b57e4500b0458bd1302c162a" footnoteRole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US">On December 16, 2022, the Company invested EUR<ix:nonFraction name="cenn:EquityMethodInvestmentsWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueAmount" id="Fact_a48ac8697a7a4e42b1afc64f258eb8d1" contextRef="c20221216_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_AntricGmbHMember" unitRef="U005" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2,500,000</ix:nonFraction> (approximately $<ix:nonFraction name="cenn:EquityMethodInvestmentsWithReadilyDeterminableFairValueAmount" id="Fact_1ae2be47ecf04058b241e053b7cfcb4e" contextRef="c20221216_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_AntricGmbHMember" unitRef="U002" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2,646,000</ix:nonFraction>) in <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Antric GmbH</span> to acquire <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" id="Fact_e0d9799ba6ce4d18bc5a63e3aa7c525e" contextRef="c20221216_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_AntricGmbHMember" unitRef="U004" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">25</ix:nonFraction>% of its equity interest. The Company accounts for the investment
                under the equity method because the Company controls <ix:nonFraction name="cenn:PercentageOfVotingInterestsControls" id="Fact_25c6bb08278347708087259a1c67697c" contextRef="c20221216_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_AntricGmbHMember" unitRef="U004" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">25</ix:nonFraction>% of voting interests, and has the ability to exercise significant
                influence over <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Antric GmbH</span>. On August 31, 2023, the Company acquired the remaining <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" id="Fact_7320e4d052154a8394103e40909524b4" contextRef="c20230831_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_AntricGmbHMember" unitRef="U004" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">75</ix:nonFraction>%
                of its equity interest and Antric GmbH was became a wholly-owned subsidiary of CEGL.</ix:footnote></div>
            </td>

  </tr>


</table>
