he Company accounts for the investment under the equity method because the Company controls <ix:nonFraction name="cenn:PercentageOfVotingInterestsControls" id="Fact_a23c6892e07a43f288cfcaf1d4a6b9a2" contextRef="c20220925_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_HangzhouEntropyYuEquityInvestmentPartnershipLimitedPartnershipMember" unitRef="U004" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">50</ix:nonFraction>%</ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="Foot_45c5c819472f46eda88fa98ad3572b366" continuedAt="Foot_45c5c819472f46eda88fa98ad3572b367"> of voting interests in partnership matters and material matters must be agreed upon by all partners. The Company has the ability to
