                to acquire <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" id="Fact_772db3d750714492a757f40fad06eb86" contextRef="c20220322_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_Able2rentGmbHMember" unitRef="U004" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">50</ix:nonFraction>% of its equity interest. The Company accounts for the investment under the equity method because it does not have
