<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">For the nine months ended September 30, 2023 and 2022, the Company recorded downward adjustments of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesFvNiRealizedGainLoss" id="Fact_a7f716cdd29049c1a3cdb7b7aa150c52" contextRef="c20230101to20230930" unitRef="U002" decimals="0" sign="-" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1,166,125</ix:nonFraction> and upward adjustments $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesFvNiRealizedGainLoss" id="Fact_954625465ebb4ec2874501cbce00861a" contextRef="c20220101to20220930" unitRef="U002" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">19,052</ix:nonFraction> for changes in fair value of both
          equity investments, respectively.</div>
