  <tr>

    <td style="width: 49%; vertical-align: bottom;">
              <div style="margin-right: 0.8pt;">Antric GmbH</div>
            </td>

    <td style="width: 2%; vertical-align: bottom;">&#160;</td>

    <td style="width: 49%; vertical-align: middle;">
              <div style="text-align: justify; margin-right: 0.8pt;"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Fact_fe22e112fa6541cbaa70797457d66e58">Invested by the Company.</span> On August 22, 2023, the Company acquired the
