      <div style="text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;">Cost of goods sold</div>

      <div>&#160;</div>

      <div>
        <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 24.5pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">The following table presents our cost of goods sold by amount and </span>as a percentage of the total cost of goods sold for the periods presented.</div>

