        <div style="text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">As set forth above, the material differences between the U.S. GAAP and IFRS presentation with respect to the Company&#8217;s combined balance sheet as of 30 September 2023 and combined balance sheet
          as of 31 December 2022 are as follows:</div>

